     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><p style=\"margin-bottom:1em;font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">I am trying to use <code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-size:13px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">nearPoints()</code> function in Shiny with bar-graphs(both basic and <code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-size:13px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">ggplot</code>packages). But when the page is rendered, none of the <code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-size:13px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">click, dbclick, hover</code> are not working with the bar-graphs.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:1em;font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">My aim is to show either a <code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-size:13px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">dataTable</code> or <code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-size:13px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">verbatimTextOutput</code> (containing the rows of the clicked bar) when a bar on the bar-graph is clicked. I can do the above mentioned operations on a scattered plot but not on a bar graph.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:1em;font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">The examples mentioned in the <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/selecting-rows-of-data.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(12,101,165)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/selecting-rows-of-data.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792398030543000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2IblrEL6qxwA3BdjhELEhy\">Shiny documentation page</a> only showed the scattered plots examples. I just want to know if the <code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-size:13px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">nearPoints()</code> and <code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-size:13px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">brushedPoints()</code> (similar function for a range on the plot) functions work with bar-graphs or not ?</p></div>"
